@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deploymentId = COLE-O-ID-RETORNADO-PELO-POST

### Informações do serviço
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Saúde
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Documentação OpenAPI gerada
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### Listar todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments

### Filtrar por ambiente e status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments?environment=production&status=Succeeded

### Registrar deployment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "application": "payment-api",
  "environment": "production",
  "version": "v1.4.0",
  "notes": "Release criada pela pipeline principal"
}

### Consultar pelo ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments/{{deploymentId}}

### Atualizar status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments/{{deploymentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Succeeded",
  "notes": "Deploy concluído sem erros"
}

### Excluir registro
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments/{{deploymentId}}

### Exemplo inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deployments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "application": "!",
  "environment": "qualquer",
  "version": "versão inválida"
}
